{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12034","headline":"赠裴九侍御昌江草堂弹琴 · 贾至","name":"赠裴九侍御昌江草堂弹琴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朔风吹疎林，积雪在崖巘。\n鸣琴草堂响，小涧清且浅。\n沈吟东山意，欲去芳岁晚。\n怅望黄绮心，白云若在眼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾至","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12034.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12034","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}